<p>Load venomous ammunition, causing ranged attacks to deal <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>physical power 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0.96, 1.47, 2.32, 3.19, 4.06</acronym> nature damage and inflict numbing poison, dealing <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>physical power 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">4.81, 7.33, 12, 16, 20</acronym> nature damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by 5%. </p><p>The damage will scale with your Physical Power.</p>